'''Easter B.B.Bunny''' (イースターウサ銀, ''Īsutāusagin'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[B.B.Bunny]] introduced in [[Cats Abloom!|Spring Sprang Sprung]]. It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

