== Enemy==
Easter B.B.Bunny is MUCH larger than his [[B.B.Bunny|Red counterpart]] and has 50 times more health and 30 times more attack power. However, it has Single Attack and has a second of foreswing, so even one meatshield is enough to stall him, though things could get complicated if many are allowed to stack.

== Strategy==
While this enemy looks ridiculously easy at first glance, it can become extremely deadly when highly buffed, such as in {{4c}} [[Rongorongo]] or [[Suffering Spring!/Eggs of Chaos Lv.1~20#Eggs of Chaos Lv.11~20|Eggs of Chaos Lv. 20]]. No particular strategy is needed when it's at a low buff, as most things will easily be able to counter it. On the other hand, at high magnifications, this rabbit can pose a serious threat, requiring strong Cats like [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Lord of Ruin Jagando Jr.]], [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N111 (Super Rare Cat)|Cop Cat]] to kill it quickly. [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] will both serve well as meatshields against the bunny, though due to its quick attack rate and knockback, using disposable meatshields like [[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]] may not be the best choice.

